# Secrets & credentials — never index for agents
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/secrets/**
**/credentials.json
**/service-account*.json
**/*service_role*
**/*-private-key*

# Agent tool dumps / local caches
.cursor/projects/**
**/agent-tools/**
**/.cursor/agent-tools/**

# Large binaries & media
**/*.mp4
**/*.mov
**/*.avi
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.7z
**/*.iso
**/*.dmg
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.ipa
**/node_modules/**
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/.next/**
**/coverage/**
**/*.map

# Maps / offline packs / model weights
**/offline-packs/**
**/*.mbtiles
**/*.pmtiles
**/*.onnx
**/*.gguf
**/models/**

# OS / IDE noise
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
